{
  "format_version": 1,
  "about": "Bandage by part (docs/gameplay/medical_actions_by_part_v1.md): the head (5 s, MedicalItem.BANDAGE_HEAD_TICKS 100), standing or sat (upper body, the head held to the clip: hold_head). The pad (WoundSkin's gauze patch) pressed on; three turns round the brow and the back of the head from 0.8 s, 1 s each (BandageWrapRenderer.wrapFrom / wrapSeconds): the right hand takes the roll round the right side to the back of the head, the left takes it there and brings it round the left side to the front while the right presses the front; the head tips back a little each time the roll passes behind it. The end laid on (3.8 s), torn off (4.0 s), patted twice, hands down from 4.45 s. The roll (player_props/bandage) keyed every 0.05 s on a rounded path 1.6 px off the part; both arms solved by IK on it and baked into the clip as FK (hold_body). Written by tools/medical-actions-v1a/author_dress_v1.cjs.",
